      "Supports keeping farmland open and free of forest encroachment. The open-landscape contribution is CHF 100/ha in the hill zone and CHF 230–390/ha in the mountain zones (not paid in the valley zone). The slope contribution is CHF 410/ha for 18–35% slopes, CHF 700/ha for 35–50% and CHF 1,000/ha above 50% (at least 50 ares per farm). Sloping vineyards receive CHF 1,500–5,000/ha, and animals sent to summer pastures earn a summering contribution of CHF 370 per normal stocking unit (NST). Source: FOAG, Direct Payments Overview 2026.",
